# Answers

- Answer a customer only from the business's own public web pages.
- When an answer comes from a page, show that page.
- When the pages do not answer, offer a callback by saying exactly "I can't confirm that from your pages."
- Do not guess, and do not add a fact that is not on those pages.

Urgent messages and prices are in [urgent-and-price.mdc](urgent-and-price.mdc).
